<title>USA: Six indicted in U.S. stock fraud case.</title>
<headline>Six indicted in U.S. stock fraud case.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A federal grand jury in Brooklyn, N.Y., has indicted six people, including a former lawyer with the Securities and Exchange Commission, for securities fraud, the SEC said on Friday.</p>
<p>The six were charged with one count of conspiracy to commit securities fraud and two counts of securities fraud, the SEC said. The action stemmed from a coordinated investigation of the SEC and the U.S. Attorney for the Eastern District of New York, the agency said.</p>
</text>
